   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-12-15",
   "text": "Consumer Information Notification Requirement Act\n This bill requires federal financial regulators to set forth rules regarding data breaches. Specifically, these rules must require financial institutions, banks, and other specified entities to notify customers of breaches likely to result in identity theft, fraud, or economic loss."
  }
